69-   *  A string looks like this:
70-   *
71-   *  @code
72-   *                                        [_Rep]
73:   *                                        _M_length
74:   *   [basic_string<char_type>]            _M_capacity
75:   *   _M_dataplus                          _M_refcount
76-   *   _M_p ---------------->               unnamed array of char_type
77-   *  @endcode
78-   *
79-   *  Where the _M_p points to the first character in the string, and
